<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "RetroHexChat uses fixed keyboard shortcuts for all actions. All shortcuts use"
  )}
  <strong>{dgettext("help_features", "Ctrl+Shift")}</strong>
  {dgettext("help_features", "combinations to avoid conflicting with browser shortcuts.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_cheatsheet}>{dgettext("help_features", "Quick Reference")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_features", "Press")}
  <strong>{dgettext("help_features", "Ctrl+Shift+/")}</strong>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "to open the Shortcut Cheatsheet at any time for a complete list of all available shortcuts."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "You can also open it from the Help menu. Choose Shortcut Cheatsheet."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_features", "Default Shortcuts")}</.help_h4>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>{dgettext("help_features", "Keys")}</th>
      <th>{dgettext("help_features", "Action")}</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><kbd>Ctrl+Shift+F</kbd></td>
      <td>{dgettext("help_features", "Open the search bar.")}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><kbd>Ctrl+Shift+A</kbd></td>
      <td>{dgettext("help_features", "Open or close the address book.")}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><kbd>Ctrl+Shift+G</kbd></td>
      <td>{dgettext("help_features", "Open the ignore list.")}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><kbd>Ctrl+Shift+H</kbd></td>
      <td>{dgettext("help_features", "Open the highlight word settings.")}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><kbd>Ctrl+Shift+S</kbd></td>
      <td>{dgettext("help_features", "Open the URL catcher.")}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><kbd>Ctrl+Shift+E</kbd></td>
      <td>{dgettext("help_features", "Open the auto-perform settings.")}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><kbd>Ctrl+Shift+]</kbd> / <kbd>Ctrl+Shift+[</kbd></td>
      <td>{dgettext("help_features", "Switch to the next or previous channel or PM.")}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><kbd>Ctrl+Shift+1</kbd> … <kbd>Ctrl+Shift+9</kbd></td>
      <td>{dgettext("help_features", "Switch to the channel or PM at that position.")}</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "During a conference, the arrow keys with %{keys} control your microphone, camera, layout and focus. The cheatsheet lists each one.",
    keys: "Ctrl+Shift"
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_options}>
  {dgettext("help_features", "Keys Without %{keys}", keys: "Ctrl+Shift")}
</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Press %{key} to close the topmost dialog or menu. In the chat input, the arrow keys, %{tab} and %{enter} have their own jobs. The Smart Input topic explains them.",
    key: "Escape",
    tab: "Tab",
    enter: "Enter"
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_document_alert}>{dgettext("help_features", "Rules and Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The shortcuts cannot be changed. Every user has the same set."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The global shortcuts avoid combinations that the browser needs, such as copy, paste and new tab."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "No function key is bound. The browser keeps them, including the key that opens the browser help."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="keyboard-shortcuts">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Keyboard Shortcuts")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-cheatsheet">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Shortcut Cheatsheet")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-smart-input">{dgettext("help_features", "Smart Input")}</.help_link>
</p>
